  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;All contracts subject to audit are included in EUD&apos;s 2022 and 2023 audit plans. Except 409-551, for all contracts an expenditure verification report is required to process the payment requests. For the contract no 409-551; the SYS_EV is included in related year&apos;s audit plan as a result of the risk assessment and upon request of the FC&amp;A and OPS.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
